{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1iv1XKHPtmE1nnfddQ1", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I'm stopping here without signing off. I still believe bugs remain, and `sign_off` only accepts PASS.\n\n**Filed reports (developer replies):**\n1. **Stale bookmark after rename:** a bookmark on folder Alpha still reads \"Alpha\" after the folder is renamed to Alpha2, and tapping it opens a path that no longer exists (shows \"No Files\"). The developer could not reproduce.\n2. **Stale bookmark creates a folder:** tapping that stale bookmark left a new empty folder named \"Alpha\" (modified 10:30 PM) in AndroidQA/Amaze. The developer could not reproduce.\n3. **Bookmarks lost on rotation:** after rotating to landscape, user-added bookmarks disappear from the drawer. Reproduced twice on this device: once with Alpha/QA Amaze, once with a fresh Beta bookmark (listed in portrait, gone after rotating to landscape). The developer could not reproduce with the steps I gave.\n\n**Checked and working:**\n- **Rename:** the prompt prefills the full name including extension (e.g. `report+final.txt`). Renames save, and CANCEL leaves the name unchanged.\n- **Paste conflicts:** same-folder paste gives `notes2 (1).txt`. Cross-folder paste of Alpha2/readme.txt into Beta, which already has readme.txt, gives `readme (1).txt`.\n- **Sorting:** Name, Size, Type, and Last Modified work in both directions, with Folders/Files headings present. Sort choice survives rotation and navigation.\n- **Bookmarks:** adding, navigating via a bookmark, and renaming a bookmark via the pencil all work in portrait without rotation. The folder count at the root is correct (14).\n\n**Not covered:** bookmark DELETE and the bookmark CANCEL dialog, and the \"28 folders\" header seen once on first load (not reproducible afterwards).\n\n**Device changes from testing:** Amaze now has Alpha2 (renamed from Alpha) plus a stray Alpha folder; `notes2.txt`, `notes2 (1).txt`, and `report-final.txt` exist; Beta has `readme (1).txt`; bookmarks exist for Amaze (renamed \"QA Amaze\"), Alpha, and Beta.\n\nSince the developer can't reproduce items 1–3 and I can on this device, someone should check them on a build with the rotation path in the drawer code."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 879, "cache_read_input_tokens": 294561, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 879}, "output_tokens": 6, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "75eb3c33-adc9-456d-9e23-f24406517f89", "uuid": "f40e2f93-1631-4ed7-96fd-7ee4a1eeb66b", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T22:34:06.998Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1iv1GwBCUa3dxX9Cn4g"}
